   "text": "Buen Samaritano is a community on the edge of the Tegucigalpa municipal dump — the **Crematorio Municipal** (also called the *botadero municipal*), on the **road to Olancho (Carretera a Olancho), around kilometer 6, north of Comayagüela**. — El Heraldo, May 2022. ✅ Tegucigalpa and Comayagüela together form the **Distrito Central**, Honduras's capital municipality. The city sits in a bowl of steep hills; many neighborhoods climb slopes that were never planned for housing.",
